    "Nothing after the failed step ran. Fix what the error names, then run scripts/reset-bae.py again." : {
      "comment" : "Welcome screen guidance under a failed dev reset in a debug build; scripts/reset-bae.py is the developer script that starts the reset and stays untranslated",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لم يُنفَّذ شيء بعد الخطوة التي فشلت. أصلح ما يذكره الخطأ، ثم شغّل scripts/reset-bae.py مرة أخرى."
          }
        },
        "bg" : {
